{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "0e7fcf87-b84b-5fe7-acd9-fd392b9f353c", "source_ordinal": 1758, "reading_ordinal": 2299, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "钢铁是怎样炼成的", "published_at": "2024-02-22T05:38:08+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/622315789/answer/2048336447946676184"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "那就不打了呀。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 7}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "“责打小孩”跟“仗着体力优势欺负幼崽”是两个概念。", "char_start": 8, "char_end": 33}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "责打小孩要一开始就约定好触发条件和形式，需要子女自己有明辨是非的能力和公正判断的勇气。", "char_start": 34, "char_end": 77}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "首先双方都同意某件事情是不能做的，太过于愚蠢和危险，做了会严重的损害各方利益。这一点结论，是大家在心平气和、友好坦率的条件下通过充分讨论和实验确立的共识。", "char_start": 78, "char_end": 155}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "同时双方也都发现要防止这件事的发生，子女一方着实无法仅凭自己自觉，需要父母提供提醒方面的帮助。", "char_start": 156, "char_end": 203}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "进而，双方都发现仅仅言语的提醒并不足以引起子女足够的重视，在子女自己的清醒判断下，子女同意父母以约定的方式、约定的程度，以责打的方式加强提醒。", "char_start": 204, "char_end": 275}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "这种双方一致同意的形式，才成其为“责打”。", "char_start": 276, "char_end": 297}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "在这里有三点要注意：第一，父母不能单方面的决定是否已经构成违规，必须和子女合议，经过子女自己同意、认可，才能确认存在违规；第二，父母的惩罚不能超越事先约定的形式和程度；第三，即使在前两条都成立的前提下，父母仍然要请子女确认，是不是要领受惩罚。", "char_start": 298, "char_end": 419}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "每一秒钟，子女只要不想领罚，就可以自己拒绝领罚。", "char_start": 420, "char_end": 444}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "这才称其为“责打”。", "char_start": 445, "char_end": 455}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "也正因为这条件如此苛刻，子女要独自做到不对自己偏私、不回避责任、不否定自己的约定，宁可毫不回避的正面坦然承担自己的价值观的审判，所以这种领受，每一下都足以锻造真正强悍、正直的人格。", "char_start": 456, "char_end": 546}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "这不是“打小孩”，这是炼钢。", "char_start": 547, "char_end": 561}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "是钢铁自炼成器。", "char_start": 562, "char_end": 570}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "这个世界上，殴打子女的蠢妇愚夫比比皆是，以“爱”之名来掩盖自己的无能和傲慢的父母不知凡几。", "char_start": 571, "char_end": 616}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "但只有无条件的严守上述准则，责罚——无论是否与肉体痛苦有关——才成其为一种对子女的帮助，成其为教育。", "char_start": 617, "char_end": 667}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "只要你越过这些限制，哪怕一丝一毫，真正属于责罚的塑造人格的魔法般的力量就会瞬间涣散，更多的制造仇恨、痛苦和对暴力的崇拜，而绝非坚强、公正和明智的人。", "char_start": 668, "char_end": 742}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "责打不是来自父母的，而是来自明白事理、已知是非的子女自身，只是由父母帮助实现，是子女自己对无可辩驳的客观规律降服自己的兽性的英勇的努力。", "char_start": 743, "char_end": 811}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "在这个意义上，每一下被自己公正的判断、自愿领受的责罚都是人的神性的胜利——我不因受审的是我自身，就托词矫饰；也不因受罚的是我自身，就枉法宽纵。", "char_start": 812, "char_end": 883}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "所以我说的话，天人共鉴；我许的愿，掷地有声；我下的断言，百鬼避忌。", "char_start": 884, "char_end": 917}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "父母虽然执杖，但在这样的子女面前只有谦卑和敬畏。", "char_start": 918, "char_end": 942}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "子女虽然受罚，但在这样的父母面前却昂藏和高贵。", "char_start": 943, "char_end": 966}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "这也是为什么应理而行的责打，反而越打越出敬重、越打越出感情。", "char_start": 967, "char_end": 997}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "按照这样的准则，责打是一种需要整个家庭有足够的幸运才会发生的奇迹，因为它需要你们有英雄般的子女——明白吗？父母们？", "char_start": 998, "char_end": 1055}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "那不是你们“气不过”就可以“憋不住”的东西。", "char_start": 1056, "char_end": 1078}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "气不过，憋不住，这是双重的无能，为什么双重的无能反而可以成就某种合法性的基础？", "char_start": 1079, "char_end": 1118}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "你们有资格把子女从你们手里承受的痛苦称为“责罚”吗？", "char_start": 1119, "char_end": 1145}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "自己想想清楚。", "char_start": 1146, "char_end": 1153}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "想清楚，该道歉就要道歉。", "char_start": 1154, "char_end": 1166}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "这个歉道下去，你们不吃亏。", "char_start": 1167, "char_end": 1180}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 30}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0340"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：打孩子的时候孩子说『有种今天把我打死，等我长大了也这么打你』我该如何应对？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029"], "summary": "围绕“钢铁是怎样炼成的”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“那就不打了呀。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "那就不打了呀。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 7, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "14f70c63-e594-5559-a6c8-a3d3079be3fb", "source_ordinal": 1757, "reading_ordinal": 2300, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "如血", "published_at": "2024-02-23T01:24:29+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/634427847/answer/3405838023"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "只要对对方有益，愿意为之受苦、受累、受委屈、受责备，只要对方知道、明白，就觉得值得。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 42}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "甚至对方不知道、不明白，只要天知道、天明白，也觉得值得。", "char_start": 43, "char_end": 71}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "有这个冲动，就是真爱的第一征兆。", "char_start": 72, "char_end": 88}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "但不要觉得这个征兆就有多么了不得，它毕竟只是征兆而已。", "char_start": 90, "char_end": 117}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "万里长征第一步罢了。", "char_start": 118, "char_end": 128}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "有了这冲动，还要开始行动。", "char_start": 129, "char_end": 142}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "一旦开始行动，那些所谓的“对方不知道、不明白，只要天知道、天明白就值得”就不再是一种浪漫的想象，而是冷冰冰、沉甸甸的常态，是每天都要生吞下咽的碎玻璃。", "char_start": 143, "char_end": 218}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "到时候你才知道自己到底是货真价实，还是自欺欺人。", "char_start": 219, "char_end": 243}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "真爱如血，绝不是软弱的人能行的事。", "char_start": 244, "char_end": 261}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "不要与能真爱的人为敌，你赢不了这种拿碎玻璃当早饭的狠人的。", "char_start": 262, "char_end": 291}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 11}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0340"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：真爱的第一征兆是什么？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010"], "summary": "围绕“如血”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“只要对对方有益，愿意为之受苦、受累、受委屈、受责备，只要对方知道、明白，就觉得值得。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "只要对对方有益，愿意为之受苦、受累、受委屈、受责备，只要对方知道、明白，就觉得值得。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 42, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "218c667a-937f-51c3-9a58-f258c50ba32b", "source_ordinal": 1756, "reading_ordinal": 2301, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "纯不勇", "published_at": "2024-02-23T02:44:28+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/645020777/answer/3405863282"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "勇于出手不是只有“怒吼一声冲上去”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 18}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "还包括勇于报警、勇于制造让犯罪者惊慌的环境音、勇于作证、勇于响应带头见义勇为的人、勇于救护受害人、勇于提供线索、勇于举报、勇于捐款、勇于转发……", "char_start": 19, "char_end": 91}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "还包括勇于“穿好盔甲拿好机关枪后怒吼一声冲上去”。", "char_start": 92, "char_end": 117}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "可勇于出的手多了，足有一千只。", "char_start": 118, "char_end": 133}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "不敢出这只，不敢出那只，这都可以，都说得过去。", "char_start": 134, "char_end": 157}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "但如果一千只手哪只你都不敢出，你就别找借口了。", "char_start": 158, "char_end": 181}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "问题显然不是你没有可出的手，", "char_start": 182, "char_end": 196}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "你就是纯不勇。", "char_start": 197, "char_end": 204}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 8}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0340"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：看完电影《第二十条》，你对不法分子会勇于出手吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008"], "summary": "围绕“纯不勇”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“勇于出手不是只有“怒吼一声冲上去”。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "勇于出手不是只有“怒吼一声冲上去”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 18, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "d52a8ba1-a3c7-5b41-8545-2b9bbb9097f5", "source_ordinal": 1755, "reading_ordinal": 2302, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "显而不贵", "published_at": "2024-02-23T15:48:43+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/50706706/answer/3406540914"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "1）说话带乡音。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 8}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "2）不多使用在场观众听不懂的术语，也不经常自造术语。", "char_start": 9, "char_end": 35}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "3）不多使用英文，英文也不过于标准。", "char_start": 36, "char_end": 54}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "4）不提自己，尤其是自己身上在场人都比不上的成就，也不把话题往自己身上引。", "char_start": 55, "char_end": 92}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "5）不计较不明显、不被主动声称的冒犯。", "char_start": 93, "char_end": 112}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "6）穿着不特殊，不穿有特殊设计的时装，甚至不穿突出性感、气质的服装。简单的放弃了“人靠衣装“这条路。", "char_start": 113, "char_end": 163}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "7）行走坐卧没有特殊的架势。没有显示出某种贵族家教的痕迹。", "char_start": 164, "char_end": 193}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "8）没有护肤、美颜、美发。", "char_start": 194, "char_end": 207}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "9）没有定制豪华座驾、游艇、私人飞机。至少没有这种公开炫耀。", "char_start": 208, "char_end": 238}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "10）没有向公众炫耀自己的豪宅、豪车、收藏。", "char_start": 239, "char_end": 261}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "11）身边没有美女相伴，也没有炫耀伴侣的家室背景。", "char_start": 262, "char_end": 287}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "12）子女没有招摇过市，不是社会名人。", "char_start": 288, "char_end": 307}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "13）很少交结高官显贵，拉贵人站台，炫耀人脉。", "char_start": 308, "char_end": 331}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "14）不打造、不维持“我无所不知 / 不能”的形象，也不直接假定自己比对话者聪明、正确，不公开做价值判断。", "char_start": 332, "char_end": 385}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "其实这些是“贵人”们和平民拉开距离的主要点。", "char_start": 386, "char_end": 408}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "如果你有众所周知的成就，而这些条你都守住了，自然平民们会将你视为“我们中的英雄”，而不是又一个人间的“半神”。", "char_start": 409, "char_end": 464}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "后者比前者容易得到由崇拜而来的影响力，但也容易中被崇拜的毒，一来容易丧失对自己的清醒认识，追逐超过自身能力的目标，二来欠下“回应崇拜者祈祷”的债，容易遭到反噬。", "char_start": 465, "char_end": 545}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "在中国，不要自命不凡、不要时时刻刻外化这种优越感，反而是身为精英必要的自觉。", "char_start": 547, "char_end": 585}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "中国人讲排场，不是在强调自己这个人有什么格外优秀，而是在回应某种职务性的要求。", "char_start": 586, "char_end": 625}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "身为皇帝，必须三宫六院、出警入跸，这是皇家威严。", "char_start": 626, "char_end": 650}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "身为巡抚，出门就必须前呼后拥、言出法随，这是官府权威。", "char_start": 651, "char_end": 678}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "身为大使，必须豪车大马，分庭抗礼，这是国家体面。", "char_start": 679, "char_end": 703}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "一旦告老还乡、私宅相见，就是布衣小帽，鸡黍为食。", "char_start": 705, "char_end": 729}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "这时奢侈、豪华、倨傲……等等一切自我标榜的行为就全都成了缺点。", "char_start": 730, "char_end": 761}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "这些词在中国的语境里就全都自带贬义，而且绝不是革命之后才出现的褒贬转向，而是几千年来一直褒奖勤俭、谦和，贬斥奢靡、越礼。", "char_start": 762, "char_end": 822}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "秦汉以来，中国的社会治理体系一直在从贵族世袭分封模式向郡县流官模式迁移，这是个非常要害的、决定了中西文化根本差异的要害。", "char_start": 823, "char_end": 883}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "在贵族世袭分封的逻辑下，就必然促使隔几代就出个白痴蠢材的贵族之家为了保护自身地位的稳固性，必须在一切方面强调自己和平民就是两个不同的物种。从血统、肤色、发色、遣词造句、行为举止、衣食住行……等等所有方面都有平民除了投胎没有可能超越的差异。", "char_start": 884, "char_end": 1003}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "这样即使平民造反，也只能选一个贵族来担任新的领袖，而没办法让一个说话俚俗、举止粗鲁、其貌不扬的人来担当首领职位。这样无论怎么斗争，都只能是公子重耳和公子小白之间的斗争，对贵族家族的总体利益并无根本损害。", "char_start": 1004, "char_end": 1105}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "而郡县官僚体制，则着力从平民之中选拔精英——它甚至本身就是为了压制高门大族垄断行政资源而设计的制度。皇帝与万民结盟，对抗世家贵族，取得社会平衡。权威、身份都与官职、品级绑定。你当着这个官、领着这个品级，你就可以有这个级别的场面和待遇，一旦不当这个官、不领这个品级，即使你家族再富有、再豪强、也不允许你“逾制”。", "char_start": 1106, "char_end": 1261}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "不但如此，全社会还会用内化到语言中的褒贬态度来规训所有人——除了皇帝这唯一的血统差异，所有人都是需要凭贤能获得地位的平民。地位差异取决于你的官职、授衔，而不是你的血统、出身。", "char_start": 1262, "char_end": 1349}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "你如果对此有清醒地认识，入朝则朱紫威严，退朝则布衣谦退，你就会得到全社会的敬仰、亲善，获得巨大的声望和影响力。", "char_start": 1350, "char_end": 1405}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "“平易近人”因此成了中国精英努力追求的一种基本价值。", "char_start": 1406, "char_end": 1432}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "而这和西方由贵族制转向民选政治后的那种川普式的“平易近人”不同。中国精英的平易近人不是极力否定自身的精英性，而是在承认、接受自身的精英性的前提下的一种对其他非精英的平民的礼仪。这表现为ta们往往是在职务场合之外才使用平民的身份，而在职务场合则使用职务所要求的术语、礼仪。", "char_start": 1433, "char_end": 1568}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "而西方民选制则相反——川普是在自己的官职位上反而刻意“平民化”，一旦退居私宅，就要反过来贵族风范十足。", "char_start": 1569, "char_end": 1620}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "现代中国是大家都是平民，担当了职务，就要有职务对应的体面——这实际上是从秦汉以来由贵族政治向平民政治数千年演进的顺延发展。", "char_start": 1621, "char_end": 1682}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "现代西方则实际上大家都是贵族，担当了职务，就要在职务上假装自己是老百姓——这实际上是贵族封建结构不断的在不同的治理样式下的反复复活。", "char_start": 1683, "char_end": 1749}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "西方的语言在honor、gentle、noble、elegant、awesome、majest、sensitive、delicate……等等与“贵态”有关的细节上是深入骨髓的羡慕、赞扬的。", "char_start": 1750, "char_end": 1844}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "而在中文中，这些词却几乎都是经由日文译介过来的新词，而且并不都是褒义词。", "char_start": 1845, "char_end": 1881}, {"paragraph_id": "P039", "field": "body", "index": 39, "text": "淘宝做广告都要舍“豪奢”而说“轻奢”，舍“高贵”而用“名贵”。", "char_start": 1882, "char_end": 1913}, {"paragraph_id": "P040", "field": "body", "index": 40, "text": "这是文化禀赋上的差别。", "char_start": 1914, "char_end": 1925}, {"paragraph_id": "P041", "field": "body", "index": 41, "text": "这也是在中国长大的中国人去西方很难在政治上崭露头角的一个根本原因。", "char_start": 1926, "char_end": 1959}, {"paragraph_id": "P042", "field": "body", "index": 42, "text": "西方的民选政治实际上是在选善于表演平民性的贵族，那并不是你考个好学校、办个赚钱的公司就有资格的。", "char_start": 1960, "char_end": 2008}, {"paragraph_id": "P043", "field": "body", "index": 43, "text": "你跟党内大佬们一碰面，对方三两句话，看你行走坐卧、言谈举止就知道你没有这个家教背景，你不是“我们”中的一员。", "char_start": 2009, "char_end": 2063}, {"paragraph_id": "P044", "field": "body", "index": 44, "text": "反而印度人、日本人因为天生的等级社会结构和西方的等级社会文化有内在相似性，那些高种姓出身的印度人会有这种强烈的贵族自觉——即使自己不是这种出身，也作为仆人、下人，近距离的看到过这种“贵人”是什么心态做派——相比之下华人连学都没处学。", "char_start": 2064, "char_end": 2180}, {"paragraph_id": "P045", "field": "body", "index": 45, "text": "所以第三世界一旦和中国、和中国人有实际接触，就会知道虽然中国人身上有种种白人老爷们没有的“高贵品质”，但是ta们是“我们”。", "char_start": 2181, "char_end": 2243}, {"paragraph_id": "P046", "field": "body", "index": 46, "text": "他们很快会发现，别看白人老爷们连个N word都咬住舌头，却还是要比满嘴说些吓死人的“歧视语言”、满脑子都是刻板印象的中国人更种族歧视。", "char_start": 2244, "char_end": 2312}, {"paragraph_id": "P047", "field": "body", "index": 47, "text": "这区别绝不在于中国人比白人老爷穷一些，而是中国人从出生开始受的就是反贵族、无贵族的文化熏陶，从基因上没有这个向往贵族、自居为神的病。", "char_start": 2313, "char_end": 2379}, {"paragraph_id": "P048", "field": "body", "index": 48, "text": "这也是为什么人类的未来在中国。", "char_start": 2380, "char_end": 2395}, {"paragraph_id": "P049", "field": "body", "index": 49, "text": "这是天命所归。", "char_start": 2396, "char_end": 2403}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 51}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0340"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为什么很多人觉得雷军的形象亲民？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038", "P039", "P040", "P041", "P042", "P043", "P044", "P045", "P046", "P047", "P048", "P049"], "summary": "围绕“显而不贵”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“1）说话带乡音。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "1）说话带乡音。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 8, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "47ac7631-ff0f-5896-a14e-f4c7de5f118e", "source_ordinal": 1754, "reading_ordinal": 2303, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "象牙手镯", "published_at": "2024-02-23T19:55:04+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/613855278/answer/3406828157"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "象牙做手镯还真是第一次见。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 13}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "象牙做小物件一般是顺着纤维方向切，尽量保持纤维完整。", "char_start": 14, "char_end": 40}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "所以象牙小件一般都是做牌子，或者抽丝做席子。", "char_start": 41, "char_end": 63}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "象牙横切成片，再掏空做镯子，结构强度极低，而且注定会环状炸裂，这种做法怕不要被师傅打断腿。", "char_start": 65, "char_end": 110}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "尤其是象牙作为浅色的生物材料，存在内部的孔隙管道，即使做配饰，也只能做帽正、腰牌这类离肌肤很远的服装配件，是不能做手把件、亲肤首饰的，否则三两天就被油脂渗入然后坏掉了。", "char_start": 111, "char_end": 195}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "象牙拿来做手镯，真的是一个很奇怪的做法。", "char_start": 196, "char_end": 216}], "images": [{"image_id": "IMG001", "src": "//asset.sooon.ai/p/2024-02/23/6b89e881005915458ca41f25680ecfaf.jpg", "status": "pending", "ocr_text": "", "visual_notes": ""}], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 7, "image": 1}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "needs_reread", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0340"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：男朋友爸爸送了我一个象牙手镯，我该收吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006"], "summary": "围绕“象牙手镯”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“象牙做手镯还真是第一次见。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "象牙做手镯还真是第一次见。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 13, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。 含图片节点，图片未经核验。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "f665267b-2668-51bb-8618-9ccbd6ff304b", "source_ordinal": 1753, "reading_ordinal": 2304, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "合理的艺术", "published_at": "2024-02-23T21:50:44+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/638128875/answer/3406939861"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "可怜。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 3}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "按这个“不合理”的标准，文艺基本跟你无缘了，能看的也就剩新闻和纪录片了。", "char_start": 4, "char_end": 40}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "四大名著，可能勉强剩半本红楼，西游记自然是不用提了，水浒从一开始洪太尉放走108魔星就已经完蛋了，至于宋江哥哥坐头把交椅，更是令人百思不得其解到了极点。", "char_start": 41, "char_end": 117}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "诸葛亮种了半辈子地，既没领过兵、也没行过政，SCI、Nature一篇也无，即无大厂经验，又非长江学者，甚至到底博士毕业没有都难说，一起步就是副国级干部、东汉基辛格。", "char_start": 118, "char_end": 200}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "合理吗？", "char_start": 201, "char_end": 205}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "有诗志曰:", "char_start": 207, "char_end": 212}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "山外青山楼外楼，西湖歌舞且未休，", "char_start": 213, "char_end": 229}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "席中客忽拍案起，直道规划不合理。", "char_start": 230, "char_end": 246}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "嘈嘈切切错杂弹，谁言声似珠落盘？", "char_start": 247, "char_end": 263}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "天台四万八千丈，牧童遥指马尔斯。", "char_start": 264, "char_end": 280}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "我醉欲眠君且去，明天再来算概率；", "char_start": 281, "char_end": 297}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "古来圣贤皆寂寞，唯有怼者留其名。", "char_start": 298, "char_end": 314}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 13}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0340"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：剧版繁花的人物剧情如此不合理，为什么这么多无脑吹？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012"], "summary": "围绕“合理的艺术”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“可怜。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "可怜。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 3, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "842bb41f-f2bd-5ee7-8940-5fcc0250601a", "source_ordinal": 1752, "reading_ordinal": 2305, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "出门右转", "published_at": "2024-02-23T22:46:21+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/626270585/answer/3406996998"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "交个女朋友不容易，不出意外你这一辈子也就屈指可数的这么几个机会。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 32}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "为啥这么上赶着要作死呢？", "char_start": 33, "char_end": 45}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "亲密关系里避不开的困难本来就已经够多的了，在这之外还要额外加码、难上加难，是嫌自己活得太舒坦、过得太轻松了吗？", "char_start": 46, "char_end": 101}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "真正令人厌恶的不是你的性观念如何，而是这种自居“不稀罕”、“有得挑”的傲慢态度。", "char_start": 102, "char_end": 142}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "这种态度会让那些符合你“要求”的人也不想沾你的边。", "char_start": 143, "char_end": 168}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "人家就是处子身、就没这样那样过，也要医学鉴定拍在你面前，要你走出这个门，这辈子也不要再出现，到那时就知道这种行为的愚蠢了。", "char_start": 169, "char_end": 230}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "不合你“要求”的你不要，合你“要求”的不要你。", "char_start": 231, "char_end": 254}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这些挑剔在没缔结关系之前你纠结下也罢了，缔结了关系你纠结，你就是自寻解约。", "char_start": 255, "char_end": 292}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "做事之前先想清楚！", "char_start": 293, "char_end": 302}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 9}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0340"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：我一直问我的女朋友是不是和别的男朋友做过，问了上百遍，她都是否认，她说的是真的吗?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009"], "summary": "围绕“出门右转”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“交个女朋友不容易，不出意外你这一辈子也就屈指可数的这么几个机会。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "交个女朋友不容易，不出意外你这一辈子也就屈指可数的这么几个机会。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 32, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "9d92960e-d71d-5f93-a80b-40c01e02af5d", "source_ordinal": 1751, "reading_ordinal": 2306, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "n年一遇", "published_at": "2024-02-24T03:28:41+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/644825076/answer/3407154737"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "45岁学会怎么稳稳的做好一个事，就是你45岁以前的主要使命。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 30}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "所谓“稳稳的做好一件事”是指“概率低于五十年一遇的事件都不能影响你做这事的成功率”。", "char_start": 31, "char_end": 73}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "为什么标准是“五十年一遇”？这基本上覆盖了两个经济周期。你要对这两个经济周期内所有的非罕见事件都有预案，都有后手。", "char_start": 74, "char_end": 131}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "百年一遇的洪水、千年一遇的瘟疫搞到失败，这不算你的问题，强到这个地步观众要嘘编剧了。", "char_start": 132, "char_end": 174}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "但是五十年一遇不算太高的要求——这五十年毕竟是在你面前活生生的走过去的。", "char_start": 175, "char_end": 211}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "这个尺度要降到十年一遇、五年一遇，很多创业计划都会得到“值得一试”的结论——这恰恰也是你在更年轻、资历更浅时尝试的条件。", "char_start": 212, "char_end": 272}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "你可以试，但不要太当真，不要借高利贷硬撑。", "char_start": 273, "char_end": 294}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "能“稳稳的做成一件事”，你大概可以在45-60岁之间净赚个一千万左右。哪怕在45岁之前背个百把万的债，只要不是高利贷，都可以很好的还清。", "char_start": 295, "char_end": 363}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "这不是指什么“称霸天下”的大事，很可能只是在小县城开两家当地有口碑的牛肉粉铺或者开了家有几千固定客户的淘宝店这类，所以不是什么遥不可及的目标。", "char_start": 364, "char_end": 435}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "关键在稳，在阅尽千般诱惑、历尽万般迷茫。", "char_start": 436, "char_end": 456}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "在这之前，一切能形成经验教训的事——甚至仅仅是你四十五岁后还会记得的事——对你都是赚到。", "char_start": 457, "char_end": 501}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "都是那个稳固起点的一部分。", "char_start": 502, "char_end": 515}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "这期间就两条要注意——一个是信用不要垮，不要对不起朋友；一个是身体不要垮，这特指会影响思考强度和时间的重度残疾，断手断脚瞎个眼毁个容都可以不算。", "char_start": 516, "char_end": 588}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "你就盯着住那个指标——“x年一遇”。", "char_start": 589, "char_end": 607}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "要达到这个指标，你要研究这几十年内所有记录良好的典型失败。自己要亲身经历、亲眼旁观一些。", "char_start": 608, "char_end": 652}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "青年最容易犯的错误，就是眼睛只盯在自己看得到的各种成功上，在这几十年里醉心于研究各种成功，这是错的。", "char_start": 653, "char_end": 703}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "大错特错。", "char_start": 704, "char_end": 709}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "你应该研究的是失败——尤其是那些见它起高楼、又见它楼塌了的失败。", "char_start": 710, "char_end": 742}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "你基本不可能复制别人的成功，因为要复制成功，你需要资本对按功率的投注，而只要资本不傻或者别有用心（比如快速摆个样子好转手卖给接盘侠），投注在你身上去复制别人的成功的前提就是你不但有复制成功的可能，而且对所有的失败免疫。", "char_start": 743, "char_end": 852}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "所以这是一个吞吃自己尾巴的怪蛇，还是要绕回到你有多少失败抗性上。", "char_start": 853, "char_end": 885}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "你对过去二十年乃至四十年的成功如数家珍，远不及你对这四五十年里的失败了如指掌值钱。", "char_start": 886, "char_end": 927}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "过去如此成功的人，如果一切照旧，几乎无法在现在同样成功；但过去如此失败的人，如果一切照旧，却几乎一定会同样失败。", "char_start": 928, "char_end": 984}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "所有的成功都是过去的幻影，唯有失败才是未来的柱石。", "char_start": 985, "char_end": 1010}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "所以不要为你年轻时不够成功哀叹，这完全是南辕北辙的荒唐。", "char_start": 1011, "char_end": 1039}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "你该为不够失败惶恐。", "char_start": 1040, "char_end": 1050}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "失败了，信用没坏、身体没垮、无人伤亡，就是巨大的成功。", "char_start": 1051, "char_end": 1078}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "在这哀叹“是不是浪费了时间”？", "char_start": 1079, "char_end": 1094}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "你需要换一换信源了。", "char_start": 1095, "char_end": 1105}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 28}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0340"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：研究生读完出来已经26左右了是不是在浪费时间?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028"], "summary": "围绕“n年一遇”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“45岁学会怎么稳稳的做好一个事，就是你45岁以前的主要使命。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "45岁学会怎么稳稳的做好一个事，就是你45岁以前的主要使命。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 30, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
